'''Fang-tastic Chocolate Chip''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Power Stones|Power Stone]], which unlocks the {{PowerStoneLink|Crumbly}} power for [[Accessories]]. The item is {{Rift Exportable}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Fang-tastic Chocolate Chip''' is a {{O|occasional}} drop from the {{Stier|2}} [[Riftstalker Bloodfiend]] or above if the player has {{Coll|Vampire Slayer LVL 3}}.

;Drop Chances
*{{stier|2}}: {{Green|15%}}

== Requirements ==
The '''Fang-tastic Chocolate Chip''' requires {{Skill|combat|XX}} to be used and can only be used as a Power Stone for [[Accessories]]. Combining 9 '''Fang-tastic Chocolate Chip'''s at [[Maxwell]] will permanently unlock the '''Crumbly''' [[Power Stones|Power]] for [[Accessories]]. 

