== Tips ==
* Despite giving less {{stat|TD}} than the [[Bubba Blister|Bubba Power]], it's better for surviving against the {{MobSprite|Inferno Demonlord}} due to '''Crumbly''' not reducing {{stat|def}}.
**Although it does not not grant any damage stats, so while it will make the Slayer a lot easier, slaying it will take a while.

== Trivia ==
* It is the only Accessory Power to have given {{stat|mending}} at some point, although this has since been removed.

